                                                "sense_id": "331ba65f-0146-39c1-8a6c-a6e47f6661c8",
                                                "text": "Glass bottles of liquid LSD; moist blocks of Manali charras and Malana cream; sachets of smack; a hundred caps of MDMA and a phial of Australian DMT; ampoules of medical morphine and a dense pad of four thousand Californian blotters."
